  {
   "t": "interlude",
   "text": "Faust's Apartment",
   "sub": "The Easel · Day",
   "duration": 1800
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "[mood:day_bright]EXT. FAUST'S APARTMENT — DAY",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/005.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust has an easel set up.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/006.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "center"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]Every one must have a hobby. Said Aunt Grace, who set me up — who sorta got famous in the wild and crazy seventies.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/008.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "[shot:insert paint_table]Faust paints.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/009.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "It's like reading to me — summoning that which exists outside and bringing it in. Painting burns an image from memory.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/010.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "I've started getting better. Don't know what that means — only that I am starting to see things which should not be.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/011.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "When nightmares keep me up at odd hours, I can relax with my demons and desires made firm in the slowing of paint.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/012.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Look what I've trapped. I think three elementals — water on the left, fire on the right, air in the middle.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/013.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust takes a hit off the joint he has and leans back.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/014.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "While I painted, I talked to them — as they were modelling, and were sitting still indeed.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/015.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "narrate",
   "text": "Faust looks over at his models — the three elements — while he paints.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/016.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "hide",
   "pos": "center"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "left"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "center"
  },
  {
   "t": "show",
   "char": "fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "pos": "right"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person_b][beat:chill]It's cool how we can see ourselves as he paints us — even if it is all just tits and ass.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/021.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Quiet while he works on me. I think he really gets it. This is so exciting — can't you see.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/022.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "You're just trying to win his favor. Make him an offer of power. Get on his good side — you're his astrological element.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/023.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "No. I think this one isn't a dick — which is exactly why shit went down so bad previously. Old white men done stupid shit.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/024.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Reminder — he's just a kid. And look at how he's looking at me. I don't think it's the flames that are fanning his attention.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/025.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person]At least he reads. The last few have been rather dimwitted. Though I think we should try and warn him.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/026.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Not to play with fire?",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/027.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Zing. You guys converse like I'm not even here. I can hear you just fine — which is cool, you dig.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/028.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "See? I told you he knew we were here.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/029.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "It's all good. He gets it.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/030.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "If he gets it, why isn't wood here?",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/031.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "She's the frame, numbnuts.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/032.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Water",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "[shot:closeup person_b]Called it. Dude is awesome.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/033.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "It could go either way yet.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/034.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Fire",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "Kid knows his shit.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/035.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Air",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "However casually.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/036.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "say",
   "char": "Faust",
   "expr": "neutral",
   "text": "I just want to paint you. Not hash out some magical deal. So apologies if I get the details wrong — next time I'll take a reference photo.",
   "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_painting/037.mp3"
  },
